WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.507
is a doll," Roxy said to Chuck.

2
00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:17.908
"A doll can't commit a crime."

3
00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:19.970
Detective Smith nodded.

4
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.310
"Good point."

5
00:00:22.191 --> 00:00:23.071
"Please believe me!"

6
00:00:23.391 --> 00:00:23.932
Chuck said.

7
00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:26.793
"Chuckles has a special computer chip in his back.

8
00:00:27.774 --> 00:00:29.835
It was supposed to make him talk and be funny.

9
00:00:30.515 --> 00:00:32.337
Instead it made him evil!"

10
00:00:34.478 --> 00:00:35.739
Detective Smith's phone rang.

11
00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:39.141
"Hello? Oh no!

12
00:00:39.261 --> 00:00:40.022
We're on our way!"

13
00:00:41.003 --> 00:00:41.503
He hung up.

14
00:00:42.524 --> 00:00:44.545
"Someone is robbing Downtown Toys."

15
00:00:44.565 --> 00:00:47.587
"Chuckles!" Chuck said.

16
00:00:48.388 --> 00:00:49.108
Roxy gulped.

17
00:00:49.129 --> 00:00:50.690
"My friends are there!"

18
00:00:52.331 --> 00:00:53.932
Roxy flew into Downtown Toys.

19
00:00:55.573 --> 00:00:57.174
Terrell peeked out from behind a shelf.

20
00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.276
He held a finger to his lips.

21
00:01:00.104 --> 00:01:02.066
Then he pointed toward the cash registers.

22
00:01:03.066 --> 00:01:05.388
Roxy saw a big doll standing on a cash register.

23
00:01:05.408 --> 00:01:07.930
"That must be Chuckles."

24
00:01:09.731 --> 00:01:12.233
Several other dolls were taking money from the cash registers.

25
00:01:13.854 --> 00:01:15.315
They stuffed the money into bags.

26
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.677
The dolls looked old and valuable.

27
00:01:17.697 --> 00:01:21.239
"Those are the dolls from the doll show," Roxy thought.

28
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.061
"Maybe Chuckles made them come to life!"

29
00:01:25.322 --> 00:01:26.123
Chuckles laughed.

30
00:01:28.312 --> 00:01:30.613
"I'm going to be rich, rich, rich!"

31
00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:32.833
"No, you're not!"

32
00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:33.874
Roxy shouted.

33
00:01:33.894 --> 00:01:35.454
"Rocket Girl!"

34
00:01:36.474 --> 00:01:37.715
Chuckles looked at the other dolls.

35
00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:42.476
"Attack!" The dolls dropped the money bags and rushed toward Roxy.

36
00:01:42.496 --> 00:01:46.537
"Uh-oh!" Roxy said as dolls grabbed her.

37
00:01:46.557 --> 00:01:48.678
"These dolls are valuable.

38
00:01:49.398 --> 00:01:50.458
I can't break them."

39
00:01:52.139 --> 00:01:53.359
Chuckles grabbed the money bag.

40
00:01:54.279 --> 00:01:56.820
"It's time for me to go, go, go!"

41
00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.861
Roxy almost stepped on one doll.

42
00:02:01.881 --> 00:02:05.442
"Whoops!" She stumbled and knocked over a candy display.

43
00:02:05.862 --> 00:02:06.843
It blocked the entrance.

44
00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:09.204
"Gah!" Chuckles said.

45
00:02:09.224 --> 00:02:10.764
"I'll find a back door."

46
00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:12.205
He ran off.

47
00:02:13.005 --> 00:02:14.726
Roxy managed to pull the dolls off her.

48
00:02:15.246 --> 00:02:16.367
Quickly she looked around.

49
00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:18.848
There was a cabinet under a cash register.

50
00:02:19.268 --> 00:02:21.669
She scooped up the dolls and stuffed them in the cabinet.

51
00:02:22.169 --> 00:02:23.370
Then she closed the door.

52
00:02:27.311 --> 00:02:28.732
Suddenly Roxy's watch beeped.

53
00:02:30.564 --> 00:02:33.445
"Terrell?" "I caught the big doll!"

54
00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:34.246
Terrell said.

55
00:02:34.266 --> 00:02:36.707
"We're in the doll department."

56
00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:38.527
"Let me go, kid!"

57
00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.008
Chuckles yelled in the background.

58
00:02:40.028 --> 00:02:41.909
"I'll be right there!"

59
00:02:42.589 --> 00:02:44.010
Roxy flew to the doll department.

60
00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.751
Boxes of dolls lined the shelves.

61
00:02:47.971 --> 00:02:49.432
Terrell was struggling with Chuckles.

62
00:02:50.912 --> 00:02:53.113
Roxy rushed over and pinned the doll to the floor.

63
00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:54.474
"Got you!"

64
00:02:54.634 --> 00:02:55.054
she said.

65
00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:58.996
"Dolls, alive!"

66
00:02:59.572 --> 00:03:00.333
Chuckles shouted.

67
00:03:01.354 --> 00:03:02.535
The doll boxes shook.

68
00:03:02.555 --> 00:03:05.017
"Uh-oh," Terrell said.

69
00:03:05.877 --> 00:03:07.979
A plastic fist popped out from one box.

70
00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.081
A tiny foot broke out from another box.

71
00:03:12.663 --> 00:03:14.724
Soon all the dolls were out of their boxes.

72
00:03:14.744 --> 00:03:18.407
"Attack!" Chuckles yelled.

73
00:03:19.008 --> 00:03:21.069
Angry dolls dived onto Roxy and Terrell.

74
00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:23.231
The dolls punched and kicked.

75
00:03:23.251 --> 00:03:26.134
"Ouch!" Terrell cried.

76
00:03:26.954 --> 00:03:28.976
Tiny plastic hands grabbed at Roxy.

77
00:03:29.893 --> 00:03:31.676
Chuckles slipped from her grip and laughed.
